  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The reaction rate for the reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>PtCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8652;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Pt</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p>was measured as a function of concentrations of different species. It was observed that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>PtCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>PtCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Pt</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced></math></p><p>where square brackets are used to denote molar concentrations. The equilibrium constant</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi></math>(Nearest integer)</p><p>Value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>X</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi></math>&nbsp;(question is modified.)</p>",
